        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.093,
            0.713,
            0.135
          ],
          "content": "Does the maximum and minimum temperature stay at the same level during these days?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.139,
            0.713,
            0.224
          ],
          "content": "Because weather depends on several factors, these temperatures usually vary every day. Generally, as we approach the summer season, the temperature rises and during the winter season it falls."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.272,
            0.586,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": "There are many techniques for measuring air temperature. Air temperature is an important weather parameter and is monitored at weather stations all over the world. The data gathered on air temperature along with various other parameters are used for making weather forecasts."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.639,
            0.264,
            0.71,
            0.314
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_12_image_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.623,
            0.32,
            0.725,
            0.363
          ],
          "content": "**More to know!**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.509,
            0.294,
            0.529
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Know a scientist"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.554,
            0.417,
            0.885
          ],
          "content": "**Anna Mani** (1918–2001) was an Indian scientist, also known as the ‘Weather Woman of India’. She invented and built a large number of weather measurement instruments. This reduced the reliance of India on other nations for such instruments. She also explored the possibilities of using wind and solar energy in India. Her work helped India to become one of the global leaders in renewable energy."
        },
        {
